{
  "uid": "k-b-model",
  "title": "K-B, modèle: qualité, coût, alertes",
  "description": "Les mesures du modèle de K-B et les seuils de ses trois alertes (observability/grafana/alert-rules.yaml du dépôt K-B).",
  "tags": [
    "k-b"
  ],
  "timezone": "utc",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "liveNow": false,
  "refresh": "1m",
  "schemaVersion": 41,
  "version": 1,
  "time": {
    "from": "now-7d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "timepicker": {},
  "annotations": {
    "list": []
  },
  "links": [],
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "type": "datasource",
        "name": "datasource",
        "label": "Source de données",
        "query": "prometheus",
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false,
        "options": [],
        "refresh": 1,
        "regex": "/^grafanacloud-.+-prom$/",
        "skipUrlSync": false
      },
      {
        "type": "custom",
        "name": "env",
        "label": "Environnement",
        "query": "production,sandbox",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "production",
          "value": "production"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "selected": true,
            "text": "production",
            "value": "production"
          },
          {
            "selected": false,
            "text": "sandbox",
            "value": "sandbox"
          }
        ],
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": false,
        "multi": false,
        "skipUrlSync": false
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Mode d'emploi",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Comment lire ce tableau.** Chaque valeur couvre une fenêtre glissante: 24 heures, ou 7 jours pour le coût. L'environnement se choisit en haut: `production` ou `sandbox` (le bac à sable). Un état est écrit en toutes lettres: « NORMAL » ou « ALERTE: seuil dépassé ». Un seuil est une ligne en tirets, nommée dans la légende. Les valeurs de chaque panneau se lisent aussi en tableau: menu du panneau, **Inspect**, **Data**. Sans appel au modèle sur la fenêtre, un panneau affiche « Aucun appel sur la période ». Mode d'emploi: `documentation/monitoring_pour_docu.md` du dépôt K-B."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Alertes",
      "collapsed": false,
      "panels": [],
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Sorties invalides sur 24 h",
      "description": "Part des appels au modèle refusés après leur nouvelle tentative (llm_invalid_output). Seuil: 0 %, toute sortie invalide déclenche l'alerte KbModelInvalidOutputs.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(max_over_time(k_b_llm_calls_total{deployment_environment_name=\"$env\",k_b_outcome=\"llm_invalid_output\"}[24h])) or vector(0)) / sum(max_over_time(k_b_llm_calls_total{deployment_environment_name=\"$env\"}[24h]))",
          "legendFormat": "Valeur",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "((sum(max_over_time(k_b_llm_calls_total{deployment_environment_name=\"$env\",k_b_outcome=\"llm_invalid_output\"}[24h])) or vector(0)) / sum(max_over_time(k_b_llm_calls_total{deployment_environment_name=\"$env\"}[24h]))) > bool 0",
          "legendFormat": "État",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "noValue": "Aucun appel sur la période",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "text"
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "text",
                "value": null
              }
            ]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byFrameRefID",
              "options": "B"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "unit",
                "value": "none"
              },
              {
                "id": "decimals",
                "value": 0
              },
              {
                "id": "mappings",
                "value": [
                  {
                    "type": "value",
                    "options": {
                      "0": {
                        "text": "NORMAL",
                        "index": 0
                      },
                      "1": {
                        "text": "ALERTE: seuil dépassé",
                        "index": 1
                      }
                    }
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ],
          "fields": "",
          "values": false
        },
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "textMode": "value_and_name",
        "colorMode": "none",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "auto",
        "wideLayout": true,
        "showPercentChange": false
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Fidélité sur 24 h",
      "description": "Part des faits retrouvés à la fois dans le texte où ils sont affirmés et dans leur source: l'item que chacun désigne, pour les fiches de veille, la source de leur texte, pour le compte rendu des tendances. Seuil: 95 %, en dessous l'alerte KbModelLowFidelity se déclenche.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 5,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 5
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "sum(max_over_time(k_b_digest_facts_found_total{deployment_environment_name=\"$env\"}[24h])) / (sum(max_over_time(k_b_digest_facts_checked_total{deployment_environment_name=\"$env\"}[24h])) > 0)",
          "legendFormat": "Valeur",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": {
            "type": "prometheus",
            "uid": "${datasource}"
          },
          "expr": "(sum(max_over_time(k_b_digest_facts_found_total{deployment_environment_name=\"$env\"}[24h])) / (sum(max_over_time(k_b_digest_facts_checked_total{deployment_environment_name=\"$env\"}[24h])) > 0)) < bool 0.95",
          "legendFormat": "État",
          "instant": true,
          "range": false,
          "format": "time_series"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 1,
          "noValue": "Aucun appel sur la période",
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
